{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview\/kcomponents()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/kComponents()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Graph.kComponents()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KComponents","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity11KComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"kComponents()","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P12ConnectivityE11kComponentsAD11KComponentsVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11Hypergraphs18IncidenceGraphViewV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","remoteSource":{"fileName":"KComponents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/KComponents.swift#L80"}},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity11KComponentsV","text":"KComponents","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/KComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView"]]},"references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceGraphView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An undirected hypergraph’s incidence graph, read lazily from its storage: a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Graph"},{"type":"text","text":" on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n + m"},{"type":"text","text":" whose vertex "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i < n"},{"type":"text","text":" is the hypergraph’s vertex index "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":" and whose vertex "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n + p"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is hyperedge "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":", with an edge "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"{i, n + p}"},{"type":"text","text":" for each incidence. It is bipartite and simple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(vertices on the left, hyperedges on the right), an empty hyperedge is an isolated vertex, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it loses nothing."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView","title":"IncidenceGraphView","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs":{"abstract":[],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","title":"Hypergraphs","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/KComponents":{"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/kcomponents","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KComponents","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/KComponents","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The k-components of an undirected graph (Moody and White’s cohesive blocking): for each k ≥ 1,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the maximal sets of vertices whose induced subgraph is k-vertex-connected, that is, has more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than k vertices and stays connected after removing any k − 1 of them. The 1-components are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connected components with an edge, the 2-components the blocks of three or more vertices; every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"k-component lies inside a (k − 1)-component. Components at one level may share fewer than k"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices."}],"title":"KComponents","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KComponents","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceGraphView/kComponents()":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/kComponents()","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"kComponents()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity11KComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview\/kcomponents()"}}}